# E20 RemoteMessages over the ActressMAS transport: the two containers connect to a server of the protocol of the C#
# (the relay of the tests), each under its name, and a message from another container names its sender
# "name@container", as in the C#: the sender is compared with its container. The lines of the C# Container class
# (connection to the server, registration, "Running MAS...") are not compared: the containers are environments of the
# library.
section ^This is Container\d$
ignore ^$
ignore ^Container connecting to server\.\.\.$
ignore ^Container connected to server\.$
ignore ^Container\d registered\.$
ignore ^Running MAS\.\.\.$
cover all
fact setup ^\[(ping-agent|pong-agent)\] (.+)$
fact received ^\t\[(\S+) -> (ping-agent|pong-agent)\]: (.+)$
same setup seq by 0
same received seq by 1
check setup count == 2
check received count == 3
